*** version
v 3
*** title
d 'PACKAGESEARCH': module to scan Stata .do files and identify SSC packages used by the code
*** description
d packagesearch provides a tool that scans, parses, and matches all Stata
d .do files in a directory (and its subdirectories) against a list of all
d packages currently hosted at SSC. It outputs a list of candidate SSC
d packages that were (likely) used when code is run.
d
*** stata
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
*** author
d Author: Lars Vilhuber and Lydia Reiner, Cornell University
*** contact
d Contact: lars.vilhuber@cornell.edu
*** url
d URL: https://github.com/labordynamicsinstitute/Statapackagesearch
d
*** date
d Distribution-Date: 20240510
d
